!warehouse/receipts/proof/
!warehouse/receipts/proof/**
!warehouse/receipts/public-records/
!warehouse/receipts/public-records/**
warehouse/.venv/
entity_resolution/eval/.venv/
warehouse/.ingest.lock
warehouse/**/__pycache__/
